# Crest: each Crest page's requests pass the core's content filter first, and
# its documents run the filter's scriptlets before their own scripts. The
# filter is chrome/browser/ui/crest/crest_request_filter.cc in the overlay; the
# renderer runs the scriptlets crest_engine_scriptlets.cc hands each main frame
# through Chromium's js_injection component. Each frame's renderer also gives
# Crest's content bridge chrome/renderer/crest/crest_user_sheet.cc, which adds
# its hiding rules to the document as user style sheets the page can't reach.

